sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Người dùng
    participant UI as Flutter UI
    participant VM as WorkspaceViewModel
    participant Exporter as ReportExporter
    participant API as ReviewRepository
    participant Http as ApiService
    participant Proxy as FastAPI /share
    participant Share as ShareStore
    participant OS as OS share sheet

    User->>UI: Export report
    UI->>VM: exportMarkdown / exportJson / exportHtml
    VM->>VM: build one report state
    VM->>Exporter: save(fileName, contents, mimeType)
    Exporter->>User: OS save dialog
    User-->>Exporter: chọn nơi lưu
    Exporter-->>VM: destination path
    VM-->>UI: saved

    User->>UI: Share report
    UI->>VM: exportHtml() + share()
    alt web
        VM-->>UI: save as file, share sheet unavailable
    else mobile/desktop
        VM->>Exporter: share(fileName, html)
        Exporter->>OS: open native share sheet
        OS-->>VM: user action completed
    end

    User->>UI: Create share link (online only)
    UI->>VM: mintShareLink()
    alt mock mode
        VM-->>UI: hidden / unavailable
    else online
        VM->>API: shareReport(html, fileName)
        API->>Http: POST /share + auth
        Http->>Proxy: HTML body
        Proxy->>Share: write HTML to .shares
        Share-->>Proxy: capability URL
        Proxy-->>Http: url
        Http-->>API: absolute URL
        API-->>VM: share link
        VM-->>UI: link ready
    end
